---@field auditLogConfigs? gcp.bigqueryconnection_v1.AuditLogConfigList The configuration for logging of each type of permission.

---@alias gcp.bigqueryconnection_v1.AuditConfigList gcp.bigqueryconnection_v1.AuditConfig[]

